# Files regenerated by the rpkg scaffold (miniextendr codegen, roxygen, autoconf).
# `-merge` makes git keep our version on a 3-way merge/rebase conflict and write
# no conflict markers, so `git rerere` has nothing to record or replay for them.
# After such a conflict, regenerate via the scaffold sequence and `git add`.
NAMESPACE          -merge
R/*-wrappers.R     -merge
configure          -merge
man/*.Rd           -merge
